cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "QHR-V2X: A Quantum-Heuristic Routing Framework for Efficient V2X Path Discovery"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and reproduction artifact for QHR-V2X, a routing
  framework that combines A* heuristic search with quantum-inspired amplitude
  amplification for V2X path discovery. Includes the algorithm implementations,
  the benchmark harness, the figure-generation pipeline for the paper's
  Figures 3-8, and a verification report.
